  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし}). Takes が particle: {手|て}が{凍|こご}える.\n\nCONJUGATION: Ichidan verb: {凍|こご}えない, {凍|こご}えます, {凍|こご}えて, {凍|こご}えれば.\n\nASPECT: {凍|こご}えている indicates the resulting state of being frozen/numb.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {手|て}/{足|あし}/{指|ゆび}が{凍|こご}える (hands/feet/fingers freeze)\n- {凍|こご}えそう (about to freeze)\n- {凍|こご}えるような{寒|さむ}さ/{風|かぜ} (freezing cold/wind)\n- {凍|こご}え{死|じ}ぬ (to freeze to death)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {凍|こお}る (to freeze - for objects/water becoming ice)\n- かじかむ (to be numb with cold - more casual)\n- {冷|ひ}える (to become cold - milder than {凍|こご}える)",
